{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Holistic & Integrative Medicine</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css">
<script defer src="assets/js/main.js"></script>
</head>
<body class="zen">
<!-- SVG background -->
<div class="bg-pattern" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<header class="site-header">
<div class="wrap">
<a class="brand" href="index.html">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</a>
<nav class="nav">
<button class="nav-toggle" aria-label="Toggle menu">☰</button>
<ul class="nav-list">
<li><a href="index.html">Home</a></li>
<li><a href="services.html">Offerings</a></li>
<li><a href="conditions.html">Conditions</a></li>
<li><a href="approach.html">Our Approach</a></li>
<li><a href="pricing.html">Investment</a></li>
<li><a href="about.html">About</a></li>
<li><a href="book.html" class="primary-cta">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a></li>
<li><a href="contact.html">Connect</a></li>
</ul>
</nav>
</div>
</header>

<main>
<section class="hero" id="hero">
<div class="wrap">
<div class="hero-content">
<h1 class="headline">A kinder medicine for your whole life</h1>
<p class="sub">{{TAGLINE}}</p>
<div class="hero-actions">
<a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" class="btn btn-primary ripple">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
<a href="about.html" class="btn btn-ghost">Meet {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}</a>
</div>
<p class="contact">Call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
</div>
<div class="hero-visual" aria-hidden="true">
<svg class="ripple-canvas" viewBox="0 0 600 400" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet">
<defs>
<linearGradient id="g" x1="0" x2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#ffd8a8"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#cdeffd"/></linearGradient>
</defs>
<rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#g)"/>
<g class="orbs">
<circle cx="120" cy="80" r="36" fill="#fff9" />
<circle cx="260" cy="160" r="24" fill="#fff6" />
<circle cx="420" cy="90" r="48" fill="#ffffff08" />
</g>
</svg>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="ritual" id="ritual">
<div class="wrap">
<h2>Our Opening Ritual</h2>
<p class="lead">Every good plan starts with listening. We combine thoughtful intake, gentle exams, and a shared goal-setting conversation to craft your personal path to balance.</p>
<ul class="ritual-steps">
<li><strong>Deep Intake:</strong> A whole-person history.</li>
<li><strong>Functional Lens:</strong> Looking for root contributors — sleep, stress, digestion, inflammation.</li>
<li><strong>Collaborative Plan:</strong> Tailored lifestyle, mind-body tools, and optional labs for clarity.</li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>

<section class="what-to-expect" id="what_to_expect">
<div class="wrap narrow">
<h2>What to expect</h2>
<p>Our sessions are conversational, evidence-informed, and paced to you. Expect education, practical steps, and a plan that grows with your progress — not promises of cures.</p>
<div class="grid">
<div>
<h3>Personalized plan</h3>
<p>Diet, movement, sleep hygiene, stress-resilience tools, and gentle supplements when appropriate.</p>
</div>
<div>
<h3>Optional testing</h3>
<p>Labs are educational tools — used when they add clarity to symptoms and choices.</p>
</div>
<div>
<h3>Follow-up rhythm</h3>
<p>Short check-ins, deeper follow-ups, and adjustments as life changes.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="schedule" id="schedule">
<div class="wrap">
<h2>Session flow & scheduling</h2>
<p>Intensive introductory sessions last 75–90 minutes. Follow-ups range 20–45 minutes depending on needs.</p>
<ol class="session-flow">
<li>Welcome & update (10–15 min)</li>
<li>Focused review & education (20–40 min)</li>
<li>Collaborative planning & next steps (10–20 min)</li>
</ol>
<p class="note">To book, use the Book page or call us. Cancellations appreciated 48 hours in advance.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section class="pricing-preview" id="pricing">
<div class="wrap narrow">
<h2>Investment</h2>
<p>Transparent options for intensive care and ongoing support.</p>
<ul class="pricing-list">
<li><strong>Intro Intensive:</strong> 75–90 min — starting at $295</li>
<li><strong>Follow-up:</strong> 20–45 min — from $95</li>
<li><strong>Package:</strong> 3 sessions — tailored plans available</li>
</ul>
<p class="disclaimer">Pricing varies; insurance and sliding scale options may apply. No guarantees of outcomes.</p>
<a href="pricing.html" class="btn btn-outline">See full pricing</a>
</div>
</section>

<section class="faq" id="faq">
<div class="wrap narrow">
<h2>Common questions</h2>
<details open>
<summary>Do you guarantee results?</summary>
<p>No. We focus on education, measurable goals, and tools to support change — but outcomes depend on many factors.</p>
</details>
<details>
<summary>Do you accept insurance?</summary>
<p>We provide superbills for out-of-network reimbursement; policies vary.</p>
</details>
<details>
<summary>Are labs required?</summary>
<p>Labs are optional and used selectively to inform care when helpful.</p>
</details>
</div>
</section>

<section class="final-cta cta" id="cta">
<div class="wrap">
<h2>Ready to begin?</h2>
<p>Start with an intensive session to build your plan. Book a time or call to talk it through.</p>
<a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" class="btn btn-primary ripple">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
</div>
</section>
</main>

<footer class="site-footer">
<div class="wrap">
<p>{{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}, {{CREDENTIALS}} — {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></p>
<p><a href="privacy.html">Privacy</a> • <a href="contact.html">Contact</a></p>
</div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>"} 
